  "scope": "Reference/archive sources, no full engine/Eigen/GUI compiled. Rust adaptation of distance and isometric bending scalar mathematics; selected unmodified C++ functions used by an independent reference with documented scalar linear-algebra shim. Signed-angle XPBD adapts the fixed ordinary PBD dihedral gradients; two additional original source files archived, no full engine/Eigen compiled. Optional Cosserat PBD stretch/shear and bend/twist kernels and first-order orientation integration adapted from the same fixed MIT release. Original rods, time-integration and call-site files archived for audit, not a full engine/Eigen build."
